<div class="container-xl py-4 narrow">
    <h1 class="h2 fw-bold">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lead">FuturePath is built for students. You never need an account, and we don't ask for your name, age, birthday, address, school, grades or contact details.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Your scenario stays in your browser.</strong> Calculations run on your device. "Remember on this device" saves your choices only in this browser's local storage; turning it off deletes them.</li>
        <li><strong>Share links</strong> contain only your choices (city, career, cards, assumptions)&mdash;nothing that identifies you.</li>
        <li><strong>No ads, no tracking.</strong> We don't use advertising, analytics trackers or third-party scripts, and we never sell or profile student data.</li>
        <li><strong>Server logs</strong> keep basic technical information (like IP address for rate limiting and security) for a short time.</li>
        <li>FuturePath is not intended to collect personal information from children under 13. Account features, if ever added, will include age-appropriate safeguards and parent/educator workflows.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
